服務",null,"0ahUKEwjF4_fe8NSWAxV-QfUHHXlFJhwQ3IcHCJEBKAo",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjF4_fe8NSWAxV-QfUHHXlFJhwQ3IcHCJIBKAs",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11rgsdbmjm"],"溏心蛋雞白湯拉麵加肉",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjF4_fe8NSWAxV-QfUHHXlFJhwQ3YcHCJQBKAA"],[["M:/g/11vry95pgk"],"蒜泥",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjF4_fe8NSWAxV-QfUHHXlFJhwQ3YcHCJUBKAE"],[["M:/g/11pzwq6k_h"],"加麵 替玉",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjF4_fe8NSWAxV-QfUHHXlFJhwQ3YcHCJYBKAI"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjF4_fe8NSWAxV-QfUHHXlFJhwQ3IcHCJMBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["極致雞白湯的味覺工程：麵屋雞金食記\n走進店內，吧台式的配置讓人能近距離感受拉麵職人的節奏。這裡最吸引人的莫過於那份「無料增量」的慷慨，無論是想多吃麵還是多吃肉，店家都給予了最高的誠意。\n本體評論：濃縮精華的黃金湯頭\n* 視覺與層次：端上桌的拉麵，金黃色的雞白湯底濃郁飽滿，配料豐富得令人驚艷。除了鮮嫩的舒肥雞胸與叉燒，竟然還加入了飽滿的餛飩與海苔，營造出多層次的口感架構。\n* 肉質表現：額外加點或贈送的肉盤更是重量級，舒肥處理保留了肉汁，黑胡椒的微辛精準地提領出肉質的鮮甜，份量多到足以讓肉控族群感到極大滿足。\n* 「一蘭式」究極結尾：當麵條用盡，真正的精華才要展開。遵循內行人的儀式感，將白飯倒入剩下的膠質湯底中，拌勻成一份吸飽鮮味的「雞湯雜炊」。這最後一擊，將雞白湯的層次發揮得淋漓盡致，每一口米飯都包裹著濃郁的膠原蛋白，是整餐最完美的收尾。\n總結評價\n這是一碗在風味與飽足感之間取得完美平衡的拉麵。從一開始的麵條彈性，到中段的多變配料，最後以湯飯收官，整套流程毫無冷場。對於追求高濃度味覺體驗的老饕來說，這碗麵展現了極高的完成度。",null,[0,107]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/974207715839783898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZDJGVmNETldSM2hZVlZkR2JWTlRNVVJPYTFaNVVqTnNiVTVZWXhBQhAA"]